{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43268","headline":"春台晴望 · 郑蕡","name":"春台晴望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"追赏层台迥，登临四望频。\n熙熙山雨霁，处处柳条新。\n草长秦城夕，花明汉苑春。\n晴林翻去鸟，紫陌阅行人。\n旅客风尘厌，山家梦寐亲。\n迁莺思出谷，骞翥待芳辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑蕡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}